        "hook": "CODY BOUGHT A QUARTERBACK AND I PAID FOR IT 😭",
        "body": "Cody beats me 132.52–123.06 and takes first on points among the three 4–2 teams 👑 This week he sent McLaurin to Adi for Jalon Daniels, then started Daniels for 10.66 against me. My Jameis brought 6.48. Man wants to eat a W; apparently I ordered the L combo 💀 Likely’s 23.9 couldn’t save me from Fannin’s 1.9, and I’ve turned 3–1 into 3–3. Arjun last week, Cody this week. At this point my weekly recap is just a victim impact statement 📝😭",
